# Optional TLS-only HTTP/1 + HTTP/2 listener.
# Copy to your own configuration and supply a certificate/key for the proxy
# hostname. Relative paths are resolved from this file's directory.
# This example is loopback-only and does not expose a public proxy.
Listen 127.0.0.1
Port 8888

TLSCert certs/proxy-cert.pem
TLSKey certs/proxy-key.pem
TLSHandshakeTimeout 10
HTTP2 Yes

MaxClients 100
MaxConcurrentStreams 32
MaxInflightRequests 256
Timeout 600
HeaderTimeout 30
ConnectTimeout 30
ShutdownTimeout 5
ConnectPort 443
LogLevel Info

# For remote clients, configure specific Allow/Deny rules and/or BasicAuth
# before changing Listen. Protect the key and configuration permissions.
# Do not enable AllowH2C here: TLS uses ALPN, not plaintext protocol detection.
